ncsa-mosaic (2.7b9-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Initial Debian packaging of NCSA Mosaic 2.7b9.
  * Build-fixed for Debian 13 (trixie): updated X11 include/lib paths,
    replaced obsolete libpng12-dev with libpng-dev, dropped unavailable
    x11proto-print-dev, added -std=gnu89 to support legacy K&R C code.
  * Added AppStream metainfo, .desktop entry and hicolor icons (16–512 px)
    sourced from alrra/browser-logos.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Wed, 06 May 2026 16:10:29 +0000
